@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions<StoreOptions> Options
@{
    var store = Options.Value;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Shipping & refunds";
}

<h2>Where we ship</h2>
<p>We ship to addresses in the United States, except Alaska, Hawaii and US territories.</p>

<h2>Delivery times</h2>
<p>
    Orders are packed and shipped by our fulfilment partner and sent by USPS. Most orders arrive within 5–7 business
    days of being placed. You'll get an email with tracking details when your order ships.
</p>

<h2>Shipping costs</h2>
<p>Any shipping charge is shown at checkout before you pay.</p>

<h2>@store.GuaranteeDays-day money-back guarantee</h2>
<p>
    If you're not happy with a product, email us at @store.ContactEmail within @store.GuaranteeDays days of delivery and
    we'll refund it. You don't need to send anything back.
</p>
<ul>
    <li>The guarantee covers your first purchase of each product.</li>
    <li>Refunds go back to the original payment method (your PayPal account or card).</li>
    <li>We process refunds within 3 business days of your request. Your bank or PayPal may take a few more days to show it.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Damaged, wrong or missing orders</h2>
<p>
    If your order arrives damaged, contains the wrong item, or hasn't arrived 10 business days after it shipped, email us
    within @store.GuaranteeDays days. We'll send a replacement or give you a full refund, whichever you prefer. This applies
    to every order, including subscription renewals.
</p>

<h2>Subscription renewals</h2>
<p>
    Renewal orders are covered for damaged, wrong or missing items as above. If you meant to cancel before a renewal,
    email us before the renewal order ships and we'll cancel and refund it. You can always skip, pause or cancel future
    renewals yourself from <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Index">your account</a>. See our
    <a asp-action="SubscriptionTerms">subscription terms</a> for details.
</p>

<h2>Returns</h2>
<p>
    Because supplements are consumable and we refund without asking for products back, we don't accept returns. Please
    don't post items back to us, as there's no address to receive them.
</p>

<h2>Questions</h2>
<p>Email @store.ContactEmail and we'll get back to you within 2 business days.</p>
